    "name": "Days Inn by Wyndham Patong Beach Phuket",
    "detail": "Solo traveller, stayed for two nights. Location is great if you're looking to walk to Bangla Road or Patong Beach. Last time I was in Phuket I had to rent a scooter. But this time, walked everywhere from the hotel. They have a travel agent desk near the reception to get you where you need or for entertainment/activities. There is security at the front who takes down license plates every time you get picked up or dropped off by taxi or shuttle van. Staff were great! Has a restaurant and pool as well. I would stay here again !",
