    "name": "Princess Kamala Beachfront Hotel",
    "detail": "We got a room with pool access which was absolutely fine. I could be picky and tell you what was wrong but all the things I would mention simply dont bother me especially when considering the price. Hotel is clean, pools very very nice and the air conditioning works. Location very good in Kamala and a 1 min walk to the beach. Breakfast was basic but fine and staff friendly especially with our 2 young ones. For what we paid me and my family were very happy and we had a fantastic time during Songkran -what a water fight that was!! I cant compare to other hotels in Phuket but if you have booked here and dont expect the Ritz I reckon you will be very pleased. Thanks to the hotel and staff for a great stay :-)",
